@startuml
!include ../_fragments/style.puml
!include ../_fragments/legend.puml
!include ../_fragments/lifelines.puml


BP_STYLE()
BP_LIFELINES()
BP_LEGEND()


title Onboarding инструмента/биржи (M3/M4)\n@version M3.v1
autonumber


Admin -> API: POST /api/onboarding {exchange, instrument, mappings, tf-canonical}
API -> Onboarding: validate & resolve canonical TFs
Onboarding -> DB: upsert exchange / instrument / exchange_instrument
Onboarding -> DB: insert coverage row (start=null, end=null)
Onboarding -> Metrics: counter:onboarding_created++


note over Onboarding,DB
Инварианты: канонические таймфреймы,\n
immutability params через registry (M2)
end note


API --> Admin: 201 Created {exchange_instrument_id}


== Запуск первичной докачки ==
API -> Scheduler: schedule History download
Scheduler -> History: downloadAll(exchange_instrument, all TF)
loop по каждому TF (от старших к младшим)
History -> ExConn: GET /market/history-candles
ExConn -> ExREST: запросы с rate-limit и HMAC
ExREST --> ExConn: candles(list)
ExConn --> History: candles(list)
History -> DB: INSERT candles (append-only, ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)
end
History -> DB: create/refresh history_group per TF
History -> Consistency: recalc coverage(start,end)
Consistency -> DB: update coverage table
History --> Scheduler: done
@enduml